{
  "id": 22,
  "title": "行业动态｜数字赋能蓉城，城市治理新趋势",
  "date": "2022-04-18",
  "summary": "今年全国政协十三届五次会议期间，智慧城市建设成为各界关注的焦点。李克强总理在《2022年政府工作报告》中明确指出，要建设数字信息基础设施，推进5G规模化应用，促进产业数字化转型，发展智慧城市、数字乡村。IBMSBIM运维",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-22.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/202241811292487.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/202241811292487.png\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><br /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">今年全国政协十三届五次会议期间，智慧城市建设成为各界关注的焦点。李克强总理在《2022年政府工作报告》中明确指出，要建设数字信息基础设施，推进5G规模化应用，促进产业数字化转型，发展智慧城市、数字乡村。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">在《2022年成都市政府工作报告》中也明确提出要加快建设智慧蓉城，推动超大城市治理体系和治理能力现代化建设。<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;visibility:visible;\">智慧蓉城是把新一代信息技术运用在城市中的各种应用场景中</span>，同时基于新一代的城市信息化高级形态，实现信息化、工业化与城镇化深度融合，充分运用信息与通信技术手段感测、分析、整合城市运行核心系统的各项关键信息，从而对民生、环保、公共安全、城市服务、工商业等活动的各种需求做出智能响应。（IBMSBIM运维）</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/202241811294621.jpg\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;visibility:visible;\">智慧蓉城建设是成都市全面推进新型智慧城市的重要决策，是成都提升敏捷科学治理能力的重要突破口。</span>智慧蓉城建设以增强人民群众获得感、幸福感、安全感为目标，破解城市中交通拥堵、生态环境污染等发展难题，提升城市治理水平，促进城市治理体系和治理能力现代化，为成都建设践行新发展理念的公园城市示范区提供重要支撑。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/202241811297446.jpg\" alt=\"3\" title=\"3\" /><br /><br /><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云自研的<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;visibility:visible;\">“开河”数字化云支撑平台</span>，以中台化思想、云架构理念为核心，依托物联网、数字孪生、云计算、AI等前沿科技技术。围绕<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;visibility:visible;\">集成接入、技术支撑、业务应用、产品矩阵、解决方案</span>等五大维度进行产品技术整合，构建起一套能够融合各类三方软硬件系统并且适用于全业务应用场景的数字化底层支撑平台。<br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></span></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">基于“开河”平台强大的技术能力，古河云为成都大运会主场馆“凤凰山体育馆”量身打造了三维可视化决策分析平台，成为了<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#0391e3;\">“智慧蓉城”战略</span>首批实现数据成功对接的项目之一。（IBMSBIM运维）</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">作为大运会主场馆的凤凰山体育馆，其面积超过45万㎡，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">建筑结构复杂难以掌握</span>，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">场馆能源消耗大</span>，绿色节能难落实；同时场馆内的各子系统无法协同运维，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">运维效率低成本高</span>；应急处置，设备分散无法快速联动、设备众多，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">难以统一管理</span>。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/2022418112106673.jpg\" alt=\"4\" title=\"4\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/2022418112103032.jpg\" alt=\"5\" title=\"5\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-18/2022418112105395.jpg\" alt=\"6\" title=\"6\" /><br /><br /><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">围绕以上需求痛点，三维可视化决策分析平台基于数字孪生技术将场馆建筑结构、各设施设备位置布局完整、精准地还原在体育馆虚拟仿真空间模型上，全新的数字化体验方式能够充分展示凤凰山体育馆综合能力，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">告别传统复杂的二维建筑结构图纸，通过三维仿真模型实现可视化管理，对内提高运营运维效率，对外提升场馆形象。</span></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云将各个建筑设备运行状态完整记录，对能耗进行综合分析管理，实现能耗的有效管控，可提供设备全生命周期的预测能力，辅助于设备的业务管理，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">实现将设备维修记录、巡检记录、维保记录、告警信息以及操作历史等信息统一集成</span>在凤凰山体育馆三维可视化决策分析平台上。（IBMSBIM运维）</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">同时，为解决各智能系统孤岛化的问题，消息中心，告警状态，实现应急事件统一调度指挥，并利用各类通信方式，保证报警信息依照权限准确同步送达，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">实现跨子系统的多设备报警及联动</span>，三维可视化决策分析平台构建了一个强大的智慧“大脑”，真正做到实时、动态、可视的对凤凰山体育馆内的建筑设备集中运维管理，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;\">形成宏观把控、微观可视，全方位覆盖的运维管理模式，全方位助力客户分析决策，极大地提高场馆运维管理效率。</span></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">古河云三维可视化决策分析平台是公司多年来专注于大数据、物联网、数字孪生等技术领域发展与演进的智慧结晶，平台可广泛应用于智慧建筑、智慧交通、智慧医疗、智慧教育等行业，满足客户对数据分析、系统集成、多维可视、集中管控等功能的需求。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-w